[{"title":"自潭山取道过玄墓","author":"陆深","text":"尽日湖山不厌多，画船初泊綵舆过。\n路从鸟道冲黄叶，浪打渔矶湿绿蓑。\n閒处风光岩壑占，望中天气水云和。\n相逢莫问鸱夷事，爱听沧浪隔树歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1759,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后对花和答沈叔明","author":"陆深","text":"三径归来春水生，送春初觉病魂轻。\n名花旧种浑无恙，携酒频过倍有情。\n十尺阑干围紫艳，一番风雨妒红英。\n殷勤寄语怜芳客，尚保丹心向日倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1760,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋后二夜与姜蓉塘诸友登楼","author":"陆深","text":"月到中秋分外清，共登江阁俯空明。\n参差渔火遥通海，缥缈鸾笙欲近城。\n满目星辰分上下，百年尘世半阴晴。\n一樽且尽今宵醉，乡国宾朋倍有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1761,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东轩春兴","author":"陆深","text":"笙歌院落养花天，六十年踰七十前。\n坐隐尚馀经国手，卧游无藉买山钱。\n江流东下饶鲑菜，风信南来有雁笺。\n双鬓不嫌搔更短，老人心事爱随缘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1762,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏移舟天马山过嘉树林听僧道净弹琴","author":"陆深","text":"城阴水木夏初临，十里来过嘉树林。\n乘兴不妨灵运屐，赏心先到颖师琴。\n望中海日依微见，物外烟霞次第寻。\n欲上前山最高处，扁舟应向五湖深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1763,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"史泾西发","author":"陆深","text":"西去青山入望多，栋花风信水云和。\n田家秧马黄梅雨，谷口渔榔白苧歌。\n星馆宛如天上列，画船疑向镜中过。\n人生合住江南老，何处沧浪与碧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1764,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨次答郑文峰正郎","author":"陆深","text":"使君本意为澄清，先遣仁声作雨声。\n百里望馀青障合，三农舞破绿蓑轻。\n贪看䆉稏行来湿，爱听芭蕉坐到明。\n无数乡心与时事，每吟佳句候秋成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1765,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑堤","author":"陆深","text":"海门东启护长堤，小筑江沙旧屋西。\n十里芦花依岸转，一川月色向人低。\n尽从鸥鸟忘机下，或有龙孙挟雨啼。\n便拟种为桃李巷，春风无语自成蹊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1766,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甲辰元宵后二夜观市灯","author":"陆深","text":"好怀佳节是乡园，歌舞楼台开上元。\n万里团圞春正月，千家灯火水西村。\n太平有象瞻天阙，老大何心倚市门。\n但愿年年同此夕，田蚕花竹长儿孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1767,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有草类藜而干生其本多绿叶至末始敷为红紫经霜更绚烂可爱一名雁来红俗呼老少年山居小阁前倚阑一株尤茂密高可文馀病起过宿相对甚适偶成一律","author":"陆深","text":"老去谁能更少年，此来相对亦欣然。\n人间白日无绳系，炉里金丹有诀传。\n秋水芦花三亩宅，西风鹤唳五更天。\n晓来霜重红于染，伴我梅花纸帐眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1768,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏五首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"野旷孤亭迥，昼长花影迟。\n蒹葭飞白鸟，杨柳啭黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1769,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏五首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"芍药花初谢，芭蕉叶已斜。\n窗前一夜雨，浮绿涨文纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1770,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏五首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"林日不到地，溪风常满船。\n雨馀黄犊健，天际白鸥眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1771,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏五首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"初日浮空动，微风刬地凉。\n苧衣人尚怯，看竹过横塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1772,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏五首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"细草缘层砌，幽禽语画梁。\n好风排户入，吹散午时香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1773,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和安鸿渐登楼曲四首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"登楼览春晖，春晖可怜晚。\n所思在天涯，欲往道里远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1774,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和安鸿渐登楼曲四首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"日夕倚楼望，行人归未归。\n断魂与残梦，相逐雁南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1775,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和安鸿渐登楼曲四首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"雪后楼偏好，青山破白看。\n客衣无奈薄，高处许多寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1776,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和安鸿渐登楼曲四首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"楼头红粉妆，楼下紫骝马。\n两处总相思，无言泪成把。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1777,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与周适斋潮州过张龙山樊柳圃纳凉","author":"陆深","text":"明月谷阳水，长桥卧綵虹。\n绿杨风不动，人在镜光中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1778,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"我有江南屋","author":"陆深","text":"我有江南屋，春深草映门。\n湘帘低不捲，宝鼎夜常温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1779,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西岩","author":"陆深","text":"我爱西岩好，桑乾绕帝城。\n黄金台下骏，细柳月中营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1780,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"陆深","text":"夜气消残暑，天光浸晓星。\n草青藏白鸟，波绿泛红菱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1781,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"成晋驿庭槐繁阴戏为一绝","author":"陆深","text":"雨意将云白，山光隐树青。\n总看行蚁梦，何日报鸡醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1782,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮至清源","author":"陆深","text":"积雪千峰白，层冰十尺强。\n吴儿浑不解，只道为炎凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1783,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"疑冢","author":"陆深","text":"疑冢七十二，冢冢浑相似。\n春风草又青，斜日牛羊里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1784,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"高鸟依依没，长河淼淼流。\n风尘随短鬓，去住任扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1785,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"弱柳风前转，新凉水际浮。\n莼鲈如有待，归日正逢秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1786,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"村村喜麦黄，南风散初暑。\n古岸绿阴中，行人自来去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1787,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"日落山烟紫，林深暝色寒。\n殷勤问前路，今夜宿新安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1788,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其六","author":"陆深","text":"水色拖苍玉，槐阴堕绿云。\n会心诗半属，得意酒微醺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1789,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其七","author":"陆深","text":"目力耽书短，归心引路长。\n深林喧鸟雀，斜日下牛羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1790,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丑归途中绝句八首 其八","author":"陆深","text":"海月和潮上，风帆接画船。\n故乡连夕梦，景物正依然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1791,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧云寺","author":"陆深","text":"鸟道千盘迥，羊肠一径斜。\n年年二三月，红杏碧桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1792,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过丛台","author":"陆深","text":"青山不改色，绿树有新姿。\n昔人歌舞地，今见草离离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1793,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白槿","author":"陆深","text":"寻常红与紫，不及淡梳妆。\n木槿篱边过，冰肌照拒霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1794,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景二首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"箬叶舟能大，桃花水正新。\n了知鱼有乐，袖手捲丝纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1795,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景二首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"自爱看秋水，鸥閒我更閒。\n蓼花洲渚里，随意弄潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1796,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"陆深","text":"蓬莱波浪浅，汀洲杜若新。\n暖云不作雨，閒杀钓鳌人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1797,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过淮阴","author":"陆深","text":"故堞初惊雨歇，古祠高枕江流。\n一抹霏微轻霭，片帆归去清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1798,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆中","author":"陆深","text":"天上文章白玉堂，日华浮动郁金香。\n词头封罢浑无事，独步花砖绕画廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1799,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴送客即事","author":"陆深","text":"洞口桃花带女萝，不知春色几分过。\n长驱白日红尘净，无数青山细雨多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1800,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和俞生暮春闺怨二首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"落花庭院草萋萋，雨鹳晴鸠各自啼。\n倦绣一春长闭阁，忽将清梦过辽西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1801,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和俞生暮春闺怨二首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"鱼书欲寄转多情，锦字回文织不成。\n落尽桃花飞燕子，一番风雨又清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1802,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗春兴四首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"芳草王孙湿未归，江南凭望转霏微。\n疏疏密密俱成阵，留住杨花不肯飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1803,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗春兴四首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"听风听雨隔窗纱，爱弄潺湲试早茶。\n更喜园丁报新事，鱼苗随水上平沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1804,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗春兴四首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"东风吹雨带龙腥，散作春声绕画屏。\n人倚碧窗初避湿，芸香翻尽太玄经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1805,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨窗春兴四首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"水心亭馆午风多，别有长条许客过。\n无数落花红作阵，一篙新雨绿生波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1806,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"东风成阵落红稀，日日溪头坐钓矶。\n传语白鸥休避我，此心虽在已忘机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1807,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"好山多在夕阳西，十曲清溪护石堤。\n临水草堂春事晚，垆香惊堕燕衔泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1808,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"麦秀风行宿雨乾，苧罗衣袂薄生寒。\n行藏欲问吾何似，尽日花开独倚阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1809,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"一卧林居独下帏，斩新时物换春衣。\n丝丝细柳湾湾水，步到前村看雁飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1810,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"细柳新蒲已满溪，独寻春过小桥西。\n奚囊佩得诗多少，欲寄相思手自题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1811,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴六首 其六","author":"陆深","text":"满蓑风雨楚江天，钓得鲈鱼不卖钱。\n十里溪桥趁归路，酒垆茅屋背花眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1812,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书扇寄黄竹泉","author":"陆深","text":"溪堂山馆带江城，睡起催花雨正晴。\n闻说閒人多乐事，臂鹰调马过清明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1813,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏即事二首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"水亭山馆绿阴肥，渐觉心情与世违。\n午睡觉来香未烬，一群新燕学交飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1814,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏即事二首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"云日阴阴水气凉，园林梅子半青黄。\n农歌野唱元无谱，和合沧浪意自长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1815,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月一日与客登梅亭","author":"陆深","text":"隔篱修竹隔溪花，浅映深围整复斜。\n风外数声啼布谷，桔槔随处野人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1816,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"野航","author":"陆深","text":"身世元同不系舟，落花时节雨初收。\n束书一枕江湖梦，流过江南杜若洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1817,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟","author":"陆深","text":"乾坤湖海总浮沤，风月图书共一舟。\n向晚酒阑何处宿，芦花千顷近沙鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1818,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画赠唐云东","author":"陆深","text":"扁舟只隔五湖东，红树青山万里通。\n回首白云閒似我，却疑人在水晶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1819,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄葵","author":"陆深","text":"碧纱高捲不胜情，晓梦初回半宿酲。\n独有丹心待高日，小阑干外雨新晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1820,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"陆深","text":"轻红浅绿殿芳晨，野水凌寒避软尘。\n一曲楚辞渔子去，隔江愁杀采花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1821,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼","author":"陆深","text":"小楼西下小西湖，淼淼烟波望转孤。\n连日南风吹不歇，自添新水浸菖蒲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1822,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蒲泉","author":"陆深","text":"移得通灵上品苗，云根新水暗通潮。\n晓来绝胜金茎露，多少明珠湿未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1823,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴二首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"春光不比秋光好，料理精神只自知。\n三月花时常卧病，晚凉日日有新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1824,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴二首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"翠竹高梧一径斜，草堂开占白鸥沙。\n秋来几阵催寒雨，报道芙蓉又着花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1825,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋节后黄葵作花满园甚富病起坐对二首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"满院晚葵秋日清，裹头强起坐前楹。\n谁云欠却看花福，病里看花别有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1826,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋节后黄葵作花满园甚富病起坐对二首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"翠节亭亭摇翠云，淡鹅黄剪薄罗纹。\n向阳心事依然在，不共南风早策勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1827,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江钓舟图","author":"陆深","text":"西风吹满荻芦花，酿作霜寒啼乱鸦。\n买得钓船如屋里，只将秋水老南华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1828,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"陆深","text":"柳外风前生晚烟，一江秋水碧于天。\n吴娃越女相思调，只爱银塘歌采莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1829,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"陆深","text":"黄花翠竹动秋容，白日沧江有卧龙。\n不是扁舟归去急，隔溪相约采芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1830,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳试笔","author":"陆深","text":"积水澄鲜云日凉，花芳开过木犀黄。\n一年又是重阳节，閒倚西楼看雁行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1831,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴五首 其一","author":"陆深","text":"花枝压雨粉墙偏，淡白轻红尽可怜。\n独立晓风无限意，为谁零落为谁妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1832,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴五首 其二","author":"陆深","text":"月明吹彻紫鸾箫，火宿沉檀暖未消。\n风送海潮来别浦，卖鱼人过竹西桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1833,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴五首 其三","author":"陆深","text":"溪亭山馆隔花分，更起江楼和水云。\n八月木犀风雨信，遍抽缃帙散香芸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴五首 其四","author":"陆深","text":"萧萧凉雨报秋衣，云影岚光锁翠微。\n人在竹窗初睡起，坐看蛛网织危机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴五首 其五","author":"陆深","text":"水芳无数长溪毛，秀色遥连翠浪高。\n欲寄佳人无处所，漫依楚调注离骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":1836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]